OL,3,GNEWSAWe went on holiday with our
OL,4,Aneighbours and swapped families - it
OL,5,Atore us apart
OL,6,
OL,7,FRachel Stone was five and her brother
OL,8,FIan was 10 when their mum and dad took
OL,9,Fthem on a caravan holiday to Wales with
OL,10,Fthe family next door.
OL,12,FThey spent two fun-filled weeks
OL,13,Ftogether - but when they got home, each
OL,14,Ffamily split in half and swapped
OL,15,Fhouses.
OL,17,FRachel and her mother Kay moved in with
OL,18,Fthe neighbour Eddie and his daughter
OL,19,FAlison. Eddie's wife Irene and their
OL,20,Fdaughter Dawn moved in with Rachel's
OL,21,Fdad Rex and her brother Ian.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
